    "classification": "normal",
    "type": "skulk",
    "difficulty": 13,
    "notes": "<h3>Normal | Skulk</h3>\n<p><em>A nimble scoundrel bearing a wicked knife.</em><br><strong>Motives &amp; Tactics:</strong> Ambush, conceal, divide, profit</p>\n<p><strong>Difficulty:</strong> 13 | <strong>Thresholds:</strong> 5/9 | <strong>HP:</strong> 3 | <strong>Stress:</strong> 3</p>\n<p><strong>ATK:</strong> +1 | Weapon: Melee | 1d6+4 physical</p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>Experience:</strong> Intrusion +3</p>\n<h4>Features</h4>\n<p><strong>Backstab - Passive</strong>: When the Shadow succeeds on an attack that has Advantage, they deal 1d6+6 physical damage instead.</p>\n<p><strong>Cloak of Shadow - Action</strong>: Become Cloaked until after the Shadow&#39;s next attack. Attacks made while Cloaked have Advantage.</p>\n<p><strong>Pick Off the Straggler - Action</strong>: <strong>Mark a Stress</strong> to cause a target within Melee range to make an Instinct Reaction Roll. On a failure, the target must <strong>mark 2 Stress</strong> and become emporarily Vulnerable. On a success, the target must <strong>mark a Stress</strong>.</p>\n",
